#   l48-migas-prep.diff   (12 senales: opp-rate, mdss-en-in/ok, res-clk-in/ok, hw-resume-ok,
#                          hw-mmu-ok, res-vbif-ok, res-enc-ok, hw-vbif-ok, post-init, alive-1/2/3)
#   l48-migas-susp.diff   (2 pokes de suspend: dpu + mdss — hueco de CRITICA-L48 §9)
# YA APLICADO al arbol vivo (no re-aplicar). Gate valido = por-tag (medido en el binario).
# ---
diff -u -r a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_kms.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_kms.c
